195
00:19:12,124 --> 00:19:14,824
Rindo Chihaya

196
00:19:15,124 --> 00:19:18,024
Kikirara Vivi

197
00:19:48,524 --> 00:19:51,524
渋谷を歩く
I walk around Shibuya

198
00:19:52,224 --> 00:19:55,224
一人で歩く
I walk alone

199
00:19:56,024 --> 00:19:59,824
人ごみの中
In the middle of the crowd

200
00:20:00,132 --> 00:20:03,832
いつ気付いたの あの愛しさ 探す
When did you realize it? Searching for that affection...

201
00:20:06,532 --> 00:20:10,532
手をつないでいい？ その思いから
"May I hold your hand?" From that thought...

202
00:20:11,032 --> 00:20:14,832
うんと早く 触れてみたいだけなの
I just want to touch you as soon as possible.

203
00:20:14,832 --> 00:20:18,232
そんな人を この私を
Such a person... someone like me...

204
00:20:18,232 --> 00:20:22,032
どうか離さないでね
Please don't ever let go.

205
00:20:23,832 --> 00:20:27,732
恋する思いが マイダーリン
My feelings of love, My Darling,

206
00:20:27,732 --> 00:20:30,832
大きく膨らむ I love you
are swelling up so big, I love you.

207
00:20:31,032 --> 00:20:34,832
考えすぎたら マイダーリン
When I overthink things, My Darling,

208
00:20:34,832 --> 00:20:38,832
空回りしたの
I just end up spinning my wheels.

209
00:20:38,832 --> 00:20:42,532
まだまだ私は マイダーリン
I'm still so inexperienced, My Darling,

210
00:20:42,532 --> 00:20:46,032
あなたが怖いわ I love you
I'm almost scared of loving you so much, I love you.

211
00:20:46,232 --> 00:20:50,032
きっといつの日か マイダーリン
I feel like someday, My Darling,

212
00:20:50,032 --> 00:20:53,032
照れ笑っちゃいそうで
we'll look back and laugh shyly about this.

213
00:21:07,832 --> 00:21:11,832
あなたを見つけ
Finding you,

214
00:21:11,832 --> 00:21:15,232
涙勝って出ちゃった
tears fell all on their own.

215
00:21:15,232 --> 00:21:18,832
少し前から
I asked, "Did you notice me...

216
00:21:18,832 --> 00:21:23,032
私に気づいてたの？って
...a little while ago?"

217
00:21:25,832 --> 00:21:28,032
少しズルいよ
That's a bit unfair,

218
00:21:28,032 --> 00:21:30,532
だけど言えない
but I can't say it out loud,

219
00:21:30,532 --> 00:21:34,232
最初のきっかけは私だし
since I was the one who started it all.

220
00:21:34,232 --> 00:21:37,032
そうよ うつむいてたら
That's right, when I was looking down,

221
00:21:37,032 --> 00:21:41,232
手を握ってくれたわ
you took my hand in yours.

222
00:21:43,032 --> 00:21:46,832
大人になっても マイダーリン
Even when we grow up, My Darling,

223
00:21:46,832 --> 00:21:50,232
もっとその先も I love you
and even far beyond that, I love you.

224
00:21:50,232 --> 00:21:54,032
腰が曲がっても マイダーリン
Even when our backs bend with age, My Darling,

225
00:21:54,032 --> 00:21:57,832
手をつなぐ時には
whenever we hold hands,

226
00:21:58,032 --> 00:22:01,832
ドキドキするでしょう マイダーリン
our hearts will still flutter, won't they, My Darling?

227
00:22:01,832 --> 00:22:05,232
恥ずかしいでしょう I love you
It might feel embarrassing, I love you.

228
00:22:05,232 --> 00:22:09,032
それでも私を マイダーリン
Even so, My Darling,

229
00:22:09,032 --> 00:22:13,032
優しく包んでね
please wrap me in your gentle embrace.

230
00:22:35,032 --> 00:22:38,832
大人になっても マイダーリン
Even when we grow up, My Darling,

231
00:22:38,832 --> 00:22:42,232
もっとその先も I love you
and even far beyond that, I love you.

232
00:22:42,232 --> 00:22:45,832
腰が曲がっても マイダーリン
Even when our backs bend with age, My Darling,

233
00:22:45,832 --> 00:22:49,832
手をつなぐ時には
whenever we hold hands,

234
00:22:49,832 --> 00:22:53,232
ドキドキするでしょう マイダーリン
our hearts will still flutter, won't they, My Darling?

235
00:22:53,232 --> 00:22:57,032
恥ずかしいでしょう I love you
It might feel embarrassing, I love you.

236
00:22:57,032 --> 00:23:00,832
それでも私を マイダーリン
Even so, My Darling,

237
00:23:00,832 --> 00:23:05,032
優しく包んでね
please wrap me in your gentle embrace.

238
00:23:46,532 --> 00:23:50,532
涙の色
[Title: The Color of Tears]

239
00:24:00,032 --> 00:24:03,232
強情 あなたは強情
Stubborn, you're so stubborn.

240
00:24:03,232 --> 00:24:07,032
分からず屋のままね
You're still as clueless as ever.

241
00:24:07,032 --> 00:24:10,832
もう付き合いきれない
I can't deal with you anymore.

242
00:24:10,832 --> 00:24:14,832
サヨナラ愛し人
Goodbye, my beloved.

243
00:24:15,032 --> 00:24:18,232
友情 「友達」なんて
Friendship? There's no way...

244
00:24:18,232 --> 00:24:22,032
戻れるわけないでしょ
...we can ever go back to being "friends."

245
00:24:22,032 --> 00:24:25,832
この先もわがままに
You just intend to keep pushing me around...

246
00:24:25,832 --> 00:24:29,832
振り回すつもり
...with your selfishness.

247
00:24:30,032 --> 00:24:33,232
浮気なら それなりに
If it was just an affair, I might have...

248
00:24:33,232 --> 00:24:36,832
許すつもりだった
...forgiven you in my own way.

249
00:24:37,032 --> 00:24:41,032
プライドを 傷つけた
But I can't forgive that day...

250
00:24:41,032 --> 00:24:45,032
あの日は許せない
...when you hurt my pride.

251
00:24:46,032 --> 00:24:49,832
涙 止まらぬ涙
Tears, tears that won't stop falling.

252
00:24:49,832 --> 00:24:53,832
これでスキッとするわ
This will clear my mind and refresh me.

253
00:24:54,032 --> 00:24:57,832
あなたを信じてた
That day I believed in you...

254
00:24:57,832 --> 00:25:00,032
あの日は...
...was such a waste...

255
00:25:00,040 --> 00:25:02,140
Ah...

256
00:25:02,140 --> 00:25:05,540
それでも愛してた
Even so, I loved you

257
00:25:05,540 --> 00:25:09,040
あなたとのサヨナラ
Goodbye to you

258
00:25:24,540 --> 00:25:27,540
動揺 心の隙間
Agitation, a gap in my heart

259
00:25:27,540 --> 00:25:31,040
風邪を引きそうだケド
It feels like I'm catching a cold

260
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:34,540
それならすぐ治るし...
But if so, it'll heal quickly...

261
00:25:34,540 --> 00:25:39,040
サヨナラ愛し人
Goodbye, my love

262
00:25:39,540 --> 00:25:43,040
薄情 どう言われても
Cold-hearted, no matter what you say

263
00:25:43,040 --> 00:25:46,540
寄りを戻さないから
I won't get back together with you

264
00:25:46,540 --> 00:25:50,040
もう電話は出ないわ
I won't answer the phone anymore

265
00:25:50,040 --> 00:25:54,040
どんなに寂しくても
No matter how lonely I get

266
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:57,540
いつもより早いケド
It's earlier than usual, but

267
00:25:57,540 --> 00:26:01,540
ベッドに入るわ
I'm going to bed

268
00:26:01,540 --> 00:26:05,040
懐かしい記憶との
It's time to fight

269
00:26:05,040 --> 00:26:09,040
戦いの時間
with nostalgic memories

270
00:26:10,540 --> 00:26:18,040
涙 思い出 涙 悲しくなんか無いよ
Tears, memories, tears, I'm not sad at all

271
00:26:18,040 --> 00:26:25,540
私 も強情ね 今頃そう思うわ
I'm stubborn too, I realize that now

272
00:26:25,540 --> 00:26:33,040
あんなに愛してた あなたとのサヨナラ
Goodbye to you, whom I loved so much

273
00:26:57,540 --> 00:27:04,540
涙 止まらぬ涙 これでスキッとするわ
Tears, unstoppable tears, this will clear my head

274
00:27:04,540 --> 00:27:12,040
あなたを信じてた あの日がもったいない
Believing in you back then was such a waste

275
00:27:12,540 --> 00:27:19,540
涙 思い出 涙 悲しくなんか無いよ
Tears, memories, tears, I'm not sad at all

276
00:27:19,540 --> 00:27:27,040
私 も強情ね 今頃そう思うわ
I'm stubborn too, I realize that now

277
00:27:27,040 --> 00:27:34,540
あんなに愛してた あなたとのサヨナラ
Goodbye to you, whom I loved so much

278
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:42,540
あんなに愛してた あなたとのサヨナラ
Goodbye to you, whom I loved so much

279
00:28:14,040 --> 00:28:19,540
Welcome, welcome!

280
00:28:24,040 --> 00:28:28,040
That was FOREVER LOVE and 涙の色 with FLOW GLOW!
That was "FOREVER LOVE" and "Namida no Iro" with FLOW GLOW!

281
00:28:32,040 --> 00:28:33,540
なんか FLOW GLOW のメンバーになった気分！
It's like I'm a member of FLOW GLOW!

282
00:28:33,540 --> 00:28:36,540
7人目のメンバー！
Another member!

283
00:28:39,040 --> 00:28:43,040
いや、めっちゃ嬉しいです！こんなに大人数で、うん、踊れて！
I'm so happy we could dance with so many people!

284
00:28:43,040 --> 00:28:47,040
まずは、自己紹介をみんなに、英語でやってもらおうかな！
First of all, I'd like everyone to introduce themselves in English!

285
00:28:47,040 --> 00:28:50,040
えー！英語！？やばい、できるかな？
English? Oh no, can I do it?

286
00:28:50,040 --> 00:28:52,540
インターナショナル！
International!

287
00:28:52,540 --> 00:28:54,040
がんばれ！
Good luck!

288
00:28:54,040 --> 00:28:57,040
順番はお任せしますけど！
I'll leave the order up to you!

289
00:28:57,040 --> 00:29:00,040
じゃあ、いつもの順番で！
Then let's go in the usual order!

290
00:29:00,040 --> 00:29:07,040
Hello, everyone! My name is Riona! I'm FLOW GLOW leader! Proper... yeah!
Hello, everyone! My name is Riona! I'm FLOW GLOW's leader! Proper... Yeah!

291
00:29:07,040 --> 00:29:09,540
パーフェクト！
Perfect!

292
00:29:09,540 --> 00:29:10,540
次は！
Next!

293
00:29:14,040 --> 00:29:24,040
Niko-tan count key! My name is Koganei Niko! FLOW GLOW... comedian modoki! Yeah!
Niko-tan, count key! My name is Koganei Niko! FLOW GLOW's... comedian modoki! Yeah!

294
00:29:24,040 --> 00:29:27,540
モドキ？英語がちょっと足りないけど！
Modoki? Her English was a bit lacking though!

295
00:29:27,540 --> 00:29:32,040
はい！ちひわ！Big car, rhythm... Yes!
Yes! Chishiwa... Big car, rhythm... Yes!

296
00:29:32,040 --> 00:29:39,040
あれ？PR担当...
Wait, PR manager...

297
00:29:39,040 --> 00:29:44,040
ちーちゃん、日本語の「大き」は英語で「small」！
Chishi-chan, the "oki" in Japanese is "small" in English!

298
00:29:44,040 --> 00:29:47,040
No! No!

299
00:29:47,040 --> 00:29:51,040
Yes, small! Classmate, thank you!

300
00:29:51,040 --> 00:29:55,040
バカだと思っていただろ！さすが Kiara先輩！
I thought she was stupid! As expected of Kiara-senpai!

301
00:29:55,040 --> 00:30:01,040
Hi! FLOW GLOW DJ and driver, Rindo Chihaya!

302
00:30:00,648 --> 00:30:03,848
めちゃめちゃギャルやってた！
You guys were total gals!

303
00:30:04,048 --> 00:30:06,548
おー！すごーい！
Woah! Amazing!

304
00:30:06,848 --> 00:30:09,548
Big感謝！Big感謝！
Big thanks! Big thanks!

305
00:30:09,848 --> 00:30:11,548
ピンク・ビーフ！
Pink Beef!

306
00:30:12,048 --> 00:30:16,248
はい、せーの、うー、V！
Okay, one, two, three... V!

307
00:30:16,848 --> 00:30:20,348
うー、I'm スゲヨ キキララ ViViっと！
I'm Sugeyo Kikilara Vivi-tte!

308
00:30:21,048 --> 00:30:26,548
スゲヨがそんな公式じゃないかもしれない...
"Sugeyo" might not actually be official...

309
00:30:27,248 --> 00:30:35,348
Well, when I chose to do these songs, I really wanted to bring in FLOW GLOW because I know they're all really good at dancing and performing.

310
00:30:35,448 --> 00:30:41,548
みんなパフォーマンス上手いから、絶対FLOW GLOW誘おうと思って、完成度高いと思って。
Everyone's so good at performing, so I definitely wanted to invite FLOW GLOW, knowing the quality would be high.

311
00:30:41,848 --> 00:30:46,048
でも、なんか困ったこととか、難しかった振りとか何かありましたか？
But was there anything you struggled with or any difficult choreo?

312
00:30:46,248 --> 00:30:50,548
全部！全部難しかった！
All of it! All of it was hard!

313
00:30:51,248 --> 00:30:56,548
え、でもカッコよかった！揃ったの見て「めっちゃカッコいい！」ってなりました！
But you all looked so cool! Seeing everyone in sync made me go, "That's super cool!"

314
00:30:56,848 --> 00:31:03,248
私も！みんなでどんどん出来上がって、完成度が高くなっていくうちに...
Me too! As we all put it together and the quality got higher and higher...

315
00:31:03,348 --> 00:31:10,548
もう幸せすぎて！「めっちゃカッコいい！」って言ってくれて嬉しかった！
I was just so happy! I was so glad when you told us, "That's super cool!"

316
00:31:10,848 --> 00:31:15,548
カノンで結構交互の振りとか、あんまなかったから...
We haven't done many alternating or canon moves like that before...

317
00:31:15,848 --> 00:31:21,048
キアラ先輩に呼ばれてそれができて嬉しかったです！
So I was really happy that Kiara-senpai invited us and we got to do it!

318
00:31:21,248 --> 00:31:26,548
そうだね、順番で回るとか結構多くて...
Yeah, there were quite a lot of moves where we turned in sequence...

319
00:31:26,848 --> 00:31:30,048
大変でした。すみません、難しい振付で...
It was tough. Sorry for giving you such difficult choreo...

320
00:31:30,548 --> 00:31:35,048
皆さんのコーナーはFLOW GLOWのコーナーであって...
That corner was FLOW GLOW's corner...

321
00:31:35,248 --> 00:31:42,548
FLOW GLOWっていうグループは、ダンスがマジでいつも難しい...
And as a group, FLOW GLOW always has seriously difficult dances...

322
00:31:43,048 --> 00:31:44,248
実力派！
You're so talented!

323
00:31:44,348 --> 00:31:50,048
ごめんね！でもみんなよくできてた！めっちゃ楽しかった！
Sorry about that! But you all did so well! It was super fun!

324
00:31:50,248 --> 00:31:57,848
FLOW GLOWといえば、I want to know everybody's favorite Hello! Project song! ハロプロの好きな曲、知りたいけど...
Speaking of FLOW GLOW, I want to know everybody's favorite Hello! Project song! I want to know your favorite Hello! Project songs...

325
00:31:58,048 --> 00:32:00,248
じゃあ、まずすーちゃんありますか？
First off, Su-chan, do you have one?

326
00:32:00,548 --> 00:32:06,548
『あーオレ！あーオレ！』が好き！
I love "Ah-Ore! Ah-Ore!"!

327
00:32:07,048 --> 00:32:10,548
おー！最近の曲ですね！いいですね！
Oh! That's a recent song! Nice!

328
00:32:10,848 --> 00:32:12,848
あとニコちゃんは？
How about Niko-chan?

329
00:32:13,048 --> 00:32:19,848
『ばかやろう！女、自分、盛大に抱いてやれ！』が好きです！
I love "Bakayarou! Onna, Jibun, Seidai ni Daite Yare!"!

330
00:32:20,248 --> 00:32:24,048
いいよねー！すごくカッコいい！わかるー！
That's a great one! So cool! I totally get it!

331
00:32:24,248 --> 00:32:27,548
結構オタクと聞いて...
I heard you're quite an otaku...

332
00:32:28,048 --> 00:32:34,048
私の好きな曲はモーニング娘。'14さんの『時空を超え 宇宙を超え』！
My favorite song is Morning Musume '14's "Toki wo Koe Sora wo Koe"!

333
00:32:34,248 --> 00:32:37,048
あー！好き！名曲！オタクは名曲で...
Ah! I love that! A total masterpiece! Real otaku go for the classics...

334
00:32:37,248 --> 00:32:40,548
『時空を超え〜 宇宙を超え〜』って...
"Toki wo koe~ Sora wo koe~"...

335
00:32:40,848 --> 00:32:43,548
カッコいい！知ってるだけでカッコいい！
So cool! Just knowing that one makes you cool!

336
00:32:43,848 --> 00:32:49,048
スマイレージさんは『天真爛漫』とか『天の邪鬼』...
For S/mileage, songs like "Tenshinranman" or "Amanojaku"...

337
00:32:49,248 --> 00:32:53,848
『天の邪鬼』は去年やってたんですよ！私『天の邪鬼』大好きです！
We performed "Amanojaku" last year! I absolutely love "Amanojaku"!

338
00:32:54,048 --> 00:32:57,048
なるほど！詳しそうですね！
I see! You really know your stuff!

339
00:32:57,248 --> 00:32:59,848
ルチちゃんはどの曲が...？
Lico-chan, which song do you like?

340
00:33:00,048 --> 00:33:06,048
私は『ソラシド〜ねえねえ〜』が、初めて聴いた時に「めっちゃ素敵な曲だな」と思って...
For me, when I first heard "Sorashido ~Nee Nee~", I thought, "What a wonderful song..."

341
00:33:06,248 --> 00:33:12,048
Buono!ですね！みんな大好きなBuono!ですね！わかる！
That's Buono!, right? Everyone loves Buono!! I get it!

342
00:33:12,248 --> 00:33:13,848
と、ビビは？
And how about Vivi?

343
00:33:14,048 --> 00:33:19,548
ビビは『チュッ！チュッ！チュッ！夏パ〜ティ』！キアラ先輩に注入したいわ！
For me, it's "Chu! Chu! Chu! Natsu Party"! I want to inject it into Kiara-senpai!

344
00:33:19,848 --> 00:33:24,548
チュッ！チュッ！チュッ！チュッ！チュッ！やめてー！
Chu! Chu! Chu! Chu! Chu! Stop it~!

345
00:33:25,548 --> 00:33:28,048
先輩、騙されないでください！
Senpai, don't be fooled!

346
00:33:28,248 --> 00:33:33,048
可愛い！でも、いろんな曲名を聞くだけで...
How cute! But just hearing all these song titles...

347
00:33:33,548 --> 00:33:40,048
ハロプロカバーソングライブ、何度も何度もやりたいですけど...
I want to do this Hello! Project cover song live over and over again...

348
00:33:40,148 --> 00:33:48,048
とりあえずは、まだまだあります！FLOW GLOWの次に他のパートもありますので...
For now, there's still plenty more! After FLOW GLOW, we have other parts coming up...

349
00:33:48,248 --> 00:33:51,048
次のパートに行きましょう！FLOW GLOWのみんな、ありがとう！
Let me move on to the next part! Thank you, everyone in FLOW GLOW!

350
00:33:51,248 --> 00:33:54,548
ありがとうございましたー！
Thank you so much!

351
00:33:55,048 --> 00:33:57,848
Let's go to the next corner!

352
00:33:58,048 --> 00:34:01,048
イエーイ！
Yay!

353
